# oc-sim scenario v1
# The routing page (journal/D-046): launch SUPERSAW from the app menu as in
# supersaw.scn, hold up for over a second to open its routing page, pick
# SUB (two detents of the left encoder) and turn it twice with the right one:
# C to D, then OFF. The snapshot shows the title with the app's name, A and B
# on their jacks, SUB picked and going nowhere.
